# R-177 local gap (D-136) — SSE fan-out: 20 long-lived streams within DEFAULT admission limits, delivery latency n=800/event type, tenant isolation, caps
# code: m9/r177-local-gaps-prep on 3e6b0899; shared 2-CPU sandbox; SUT = real uvicorn in its own OS process; clients from distinct loopback source IPs 127.0.0.2..5; live-local = loopback PostgreSQL+PostgREST
# command: python3 benchmarks/r177/sse_fanout_bench.py [--storage live-local] --json ...   (40 tasks/tenant at 2/s, 2 tenants × 2 IPs × 5 streams)
