## reading
- isolation on the stream holds under fan-out: 0 events of the other tenant on any of 20 streams, every stream saw every task of its tenant, 0 gap events, both storage modes.
- the caps answer at the edge: 6th stream from one IP → 429 Retry-After 30; 11th stream of one tenant from a new IP → 429 Retry-After 30.
- live-local task_started/completed latency (~135–145ms p50, p95 ~232–242ms) is dominated by the task lifecycle writing through PostgREST on the same 2-CPU node, not by the SSE fan-out itself (task_created p95 28ms).
- NOT measured: hundreds/thousands of concurrent streams (needs raised limits + isolated env: R-180/R-181, Q-023), browser EventSource, reverse proxies.
